  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Decarbonizing Indonesia through Biogas</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to jump-start &#x2018;Scaling-up of Waste to BioCNG in Indonesia&#x2019; and create the market conditions to scale up investments in waste management and to accelerate the development of methane waste to BioCNG technology through establishing a financing facility. The project is shortlisted for the KGNDF and awaiting a final approval. The idea is to develop a concept note using the KGNDF funding.</narrative>
  </description>
